    "text": "Let <math><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi></math> be such that <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then:",
