  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#969;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Using the given condition&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6d93483a-6d23-4e29-a9d9-139fafe1e404-image8.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 160px;\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that the locus of a complex number&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the perpendicular bisector of the line segment joining the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Hence, the&nbsp;locus of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math>&nbsp;satisfying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, <math><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
